WEBVTT

1
00:00:25.544 --> 00:00:27.739
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Ah, come in.

2
00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.957
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Thank you.

3
00:00:40.005 --> 00:00:41.947
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Can you confirm your name, please?

4
00:00:42.517 --> 00:00:44.565
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Yes, I’m Barbara Travers.

5
00:00:46.275 --> 00:00:52.186
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> OK, Ms Travers, what did you do after dinner yesterday evening?

6
00:00:53.516 --> 00:00:58.477
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> After dinner? I played cards with Gordon, and then I went to bed.

7
00:00:59.427 --> 00:01:01.432
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> What time was that?

8
00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:07.554
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> It was about half past eleven. I remember, I looked at my watch

9
00:01:10.742 --> 00:01:14.267
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you hear anything in your father’s room?

10
00:01:15.851 --> 00:01:17.709
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> No. I didn’t hear anything.

11
00:01:20.263 --> 00:01:27.736
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Miss Travers, did you have any problems with your father?

12
00:01:28.122 --> 00:01:40.203
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> No, I didn’t have any problems with him at all. Daddy was a wonderful man, a wonderful father.

13
00:01:49.184 --> 00:01:51.660
Sorry, Inspector.

14
00:01:52.942 --> 00:01:59.571
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> OK, Miss Travers. No more questions. Could you ask Mr Summers to come in, please?

15
00:01:59.782 --> 00:02:01.724
<v><b>Barbara:</b></v> Of course.

16
00:02:10.781 --> 00:02:12.216
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Mr Summers.

17
00:02:12.807 --> 00:02:14.243
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Call me Gordon.

18
00:02:16.291 --> 00:02:25.284
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Thank you, er…Gordon. What did you do after dinner?

19
00:02:26.529 --> 00:02:30.878
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> I played cards with Barbara. Then she went to bed.

20
00:02:33.348 --> 00:02:35.164
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you go to bed then?

21
00:02:35.586 --> 00:02:42.362
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> No. I stayed in the living room and I had a glass of whisky. Then I went to bed.

22
00:02:43.777 --> 00:02:45.170
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> What time was that?

23
00:02:46.416 --> 00:02:54.944
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> I don’t remember exactly. I didn’t look at the time.

24
00:02:59.272 --> 00:03:02.249
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you hear anything during the night?

25
00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:07.737
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> No, I didn’t. I was very tired. I slept very well.

26
00:03:13.458 --> 00:03:17.723
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> You and Mr Travers were business partners, weren’t you?

27
00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:20.151
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Yes, that’s right.

28
00:03:21.903 --> 00:03:27.624
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> And it’s a very good business, I understand.

29
00:03:29.228 --> 00:03:32.099
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Yes, Inspector, it is.

30
00:03:33.303 --> 00:03:35.160
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> And now it’s your business.

31
00:03:35.329 --> 00:03:43.119
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Listen, Inspector, I did not kill Jeremy. He was my partner and he was my friend.

32
00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:55.617
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Very well, Gordon. Could you ask Ms Pasquale to come in, please?

33
00:03:55.997 --> 00:03:57.158
<v><b>Gordon:</b></v> Certainly.

34
00:04:13.814 --> 00:04:16.326
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Ah, good morning Miss…

35
00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:18.881
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Pasquale. Claudia Pasquale.

36
00:04:19.714 --> 00:04:21.351
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Take a seat, Ms Pasquale.

37
00:04:21.614 --> 00:04:22.733
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Thank you.

38
00:04:24.264 --> 00:04:31.441
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> So, Ms Pasquale, what did you do after dinner, yesterday evening?

39
00:04:32.223 --> 00:04:37.732
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> I went to my room and I had a bath and I went to bed.

40
00:04:38.324 --> 00:04:39.654
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> What time was that?

41
00:04:40.223 --> 00:04:42.039
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> About 11 o’clock.

42
00:04:44.551 --> 00:04:46.704
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you hear anything?

43
00:04:47.338 --> 00:04:53.840
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Yes. I heard somebody go into Jeremy’s room. It was about twelve o’clock.

44
00:04:54.663 --> 00:04:55.803
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Who was it?

45
00:04:56.584 --> 00:04:59.160
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> It was Amanda, his wife.

46
00:04:59.329 --> 00:05:02.094
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Are you sure? Did you see her?

47
00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:07.182
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Well, no, I didn’t see her. But I’m sure it was Amanda.

48
00:05:11.151 --> 00:05:16.597
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> You were Mr Travers’s secretary, weren’t you Claudia?

49
00:05:18.307 --> 00:05:19.616
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Yes, I was.

50
00:05:21.938 --> 00:05:23.712
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Were you just his secretary?

51
00:05:24.366 --> 00:05:25.802
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> What do you mean?

52
00:05:27.638 --> 00:05:29.918
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Were you in love with Mr Travers, Claudia?

53
00:05:30.024 --> 00:05:31.945
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> No, I wasn’t.

54
00:05:33.127 --> 00:05:35.175
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> The truth please, Claudia.

55
00:05:40.283 --> 00:05:47.714
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> Very well, Inspector. Yes, I was in love with him and he said that he was in love with me.

56
00:05:47.989 --> 00:05:54.871
He said he wanted to leave his wife – Amanda – and marry me. I was stupid. I believed him.

57
00:05:55.145 --> 00:06:01.542
But he didn’t leave her. He used me, Inspector! I was very angry with him.

58
00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:03.336
<v><b>Inspector:</b></v> Did you kill him.

59
00:06:03.526 --> 00:06:06.967
<v><b>Claudia:</b></v> No, Inspector. I loved Jeremy.